<!DOCTYPE html>
<html xmlns:th="http://www.thymeleaf.org">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>New Booking Alert</title>
</head>
<body>
    <h2>New Booking Alert</h2>
    <p>Hi <b th:text="${providerName}">Provider Name</b>,</p>
    <p>A new booking has been made for your service <b th:text="${serviceName}">Service Name</b>.</p>
    <p>
        <b>Customer:</b> <span th:text="${userName}">Customer Name</span><br>
        <b>Date:</b> <span th:text="${date}">2025-09-22</span><br>
        <b>Time:</b> <span th:text="${startTime}">10:00</span> to <span th:text="${endTime}">11:00</span><br>
        <b>Price:</b> $<span th:text="${price}">100</span>
    </p>
    <p>Please prepare accordingly!</p>
</body>
</html>
